{"4325220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Girl In Darkness", "steam_appid": 4325220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Surge forth from thy tranquil abode, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and undulate turbulently in the ganglionic causeways of yonder lagoon.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325220/extras/6c6ce242008157db8e1c13c072cf8345.avif?t=1772657338\" width=1111 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse miserable ruins and seek opulent prizes. Ascend from the grotto to confront the disgraceful entity. Acquaint yourself with charming inhabitants. Or become infected and lose all hope as you behold the branching tunnels of tainted mucus.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate bathing systems and bathing tanks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become closed (if you are open then distort into closed state).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is directed to press a variety of buttons on their chosen device.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Methodology for mixing of subject and object through a process of nervous system extension or cranial deracination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discretional aspects include exploration, violence, attire, angling and other tedious and dreary tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undergo recursive encystment, but beware of doppelganger homunculi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is encouraged to linger on areas of interest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_